do MusicPlayer.pause_music()
audio "res://Audio/Music/TutorialCutscene.wav" [bus="Music"]
do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
join "Chef Nadene" rightmost [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
"Chef Nadene": Hey newbie! Names, Chef Nadene. I run the culinary department for the Starspire Hunters. I'm responsible for overseeing what keeps ya'll fed., so be gratful.. or don't be surprised if ya'lls rations shrink overtime.
"Chef Nadene": HA HA HA! I'm just yankin' your chain.\
\
Thanks for helping us repair the Cooking Range. This thing can get on the fritz sometimes - so it's important for us Hunters to keep on top of keeping this baby running. After all, this thing is the basis of our livelyhoods!
"Chef Nadene": Also, be sure to check out the cooking upgrades in the ol' Computer Terminal, they can certainly be great for assisting you in becoming a more proficient cook.
"Chef Nadene": Have at it! And may your bounty be plentifyful.
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_player()
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do MusicPlayer.unpause_music()